{"metadata":{"taxon":[{"Plain":"Wiki. "},2],"title":[{"Plain":"“Dolbeault–Dirac 算子”"},1],"slug":[{"Plain":"Dolbeault--Dirac 算子"},0]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>在具有自旋结构的 [Kähler 流形](Kähler 流形.md)上, [Dolbeault 上同调](Dolbeault 算子.md)与其伴随算子之和是 [Dirac 算子](Dirac 算子.md), 其"},{"Local":{"url":"解析指标","text":"解析指标"}},{"Plain":"等于 [Todd 类](Todd 类.md).</p>\n"}]}}